  "text": "Your look for the morning service combines a tailored graphite blazer with your own dark brown wool shirt underneath. This is layered over a grey trapeze skirt featuring delicate lace detailing that adds a touch of quiet grace without being flashy. Around your neck, you wear a soft brown knit scarf to add warmth and texture, while your feet are grounded in sturdy ankle boots with a comfortable sole for standing or walking during the ceremony. The dark, neutral tones of the blazer and skirt honor the solemnity of the occasion, while the rich chocolate of the shirt, scarf, and shoes provide a cohesive, warm depth that suits an autumn day. The gold accents on your boots complement your natural coloring perfectly.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the blouse buttoned up under the blazer for a neat, respectful line at the neckline.",
    "Let the brown scarf hang loosely over the shirt collar to soften the sharp edges of the suit."
  ],
